AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000112 obo:OBI_0000571 "With respect to The Accuri C6 Flow Cytometer System, the organization Accuri bears the role manufacturer role.  With respect to a transformed line of tissue culture cells derived by a specific lab, the lab whose personnel isolated the cll line bears the role manufacturer role.  With respect to a specific antibody produced by an individual scientist, the scientist who purifies, characterizes and distributes the anitbody bears the role manufacturer role.")
