AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000119 co:PMD_0000534 "“Blank.” Merriam-Webster.com Dictionary, Merriam-Webster, https://www.merriam-webster.com/dictionary/blank. Accessed 25 Nov. 2022."@en)
