AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label co:PMD_0025020 "single fatigue testing process"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition co:PMD_0025020 "Mechanical property analyzing process that is an occurent part of a fatigue testing process (S-N testing process). A single fatigue testing process assesses how many cycles a material can withstand under the given loading."@en)
SubClassOf(co:PMD_0025020 co:PMD_0000849)

