AnnotationAssertion(skos:comment co:PMD_0027001 "It may part of a lamellae object oggregate")
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition co:PMD_0027001 "lamella is an object that represents a thin, flat, plate-like layer or flake within microstructure."@en)
