AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000116 co:PMD_0080103 "Necessary and sufficient conditions for 'volume concentration' have not yet been formalized. The term is defined as a specific subtype of 'volume ratio'. Distinguishing criteria are domain-specific and depend on measurement conventions or source terminology not yet expressed as OWL restrictions. The definition is adapted from: https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Volumenkonzentration."@en)
