AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition co:PMD_0090016 "material intentionally processed from materials derived from living (or once-living) organisms"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:example co:PMD_0090016 "Engineered Biopolymers such as Polylactic Acid (PLA);  Reconstituted Biopolymers such as Regenerated Cellulose (Rayon/Viscose); Biocomposites such as Wood-Plastic Composites (WPC);  Biochemicals (e.g. Bio-based Adhesives)")
